 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516558,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "TikTok has an estimated 80,000,000 (80 million) registered users in the United States. The population of the United States is 332,403,650. What percent of the U.S. population are registered TikTok users? If necessary, round to two decimal places.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The formula relating the total (base), the percent in decimal form, and the part (amount) is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span>.</p>\n<p>80,000,000 is what percent of 332,403,650?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"80,000,000 = percent \\times 332,403,650\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{80,000,000}}{{332,403,650}} = \\frac{{percent \\times \\cancel{{332,403,650}}}}{{\\cancel{{332,403,650}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.24067 \\approx percent\"></span></p>\n<p>To convert the number <i>x</i> from decimal form to percent, multiply <i>x</i> by 100 and place a percent sign, %, after the number: (<i>x</i> × 100)%.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.24067\"></span>≈ 24.07% (an approximation)</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "24.07%"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
